WEBVTT

38:04.084 --> 38:05.125
And a finger.

38:05.625 --> 38:09.000
Bro, bro, bro… I'm sorry.
Please don't mind.

38:09.084 --> 38:11.542
I have a judgment issue due to this eye.

38:11.709 --> 38:13.459
I can't see things clearly.

38:13.542 --> 38:14.667
Hence the lapse in judgment.

38:15.375 --> 38:18.542
What are you guys looking at?
Rush him to the hospital.
